WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.595
Brad: It’s recess time.

2
00:00:14.596 --> 00:00:16.566
Tina: Is everything okay?

3
00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:19.802
Brad: Yeah, you were making strange noises.

4
00:00:19.803 --> 00:00:22.954
Brad: We saw you moving like a jumping bean.

5
00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:25.165
Danny: You didn’t see him?

6
00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:28.755
Tina & Brad: See who?

7
00:00:28.756 --> 00:00:33.126
Danny: Well, I saw him and I know he’s real!

8
00:00:33.127 --> 00:00:35.717
Brad: Who’s real?

9
00:00:35.718 --> 00:00:37.878
Danny: Aha! It’s here!

10
00:00:37.879 --> 00:00:39.549
He left the clay for me.

11
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:42.518
Tina: Danny, you’re acting really weird.

12
00:00:42.519 --> 00:00:52.860
Danny: Let’s go! Follow me to our secret place! Hurry!

13
00:00:52.861 --> 00:00:55.599
Danny: You guys have to listen to me.

14
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.439
Tina: Okay.

15
00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.590
Danny: And believe me.

16
00:00:59.591 --> 00:01:03.790
Brad: Well, that depends on what you say.

17
00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:07.285
Danny: Okay. I just had a visit.

18
00:01:07.286 --> 00:01:10.018
Brad: You were asleep at your desk.

19
00:01:10.019 --> 00:01:12.885
Danny: No, no. Just listen─

20
00:01:12.886 --> 00:01:15.650
Brad: Well, you’re not making any sense.

21
00:01:15.651 --> 00:01:18.649
Tina: Brad, just listen to Danny.

22
00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:23.319
Danny: Thank you. My visitor was a giant named Hopian.

23
00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.701
Danny: We have to go to his world.

24
00:01:25.702 --> 00:01:27.846
It’s called Ginormous.

25
00:01:27.847 --> 00:01:37.247
Danny: We have to bring back the lost color to his world.

26
00:01:37.248 --> 00:01:39.423
Tina: That’s a good one, Danny!

27
00:01:39.424 --> 00:01:42.535
Brad: And you were so serious the whole time!

28
00:01:42.536 --> 00:01:44.417
Tina: A giant!

29
00:01:44.418 --> 00:01:47.457
Brad: Bring back the lost color!

30
00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:50.271
Danny: I’m serious!

31
00:01:50.272 --> 00:01:54.978
Brad: Danny, you had a dream about art class. That’s all.

32
00:01:54.979 --> 00:01:58.514
Tina: You have got the wildest imagination.

33
00:01:58.515 --> 00:02:02.311
Danny: That’s what Hopian said!

34
00:02:02.312 --> 00:02:07.187
Tina: Sorry, Danny. But I’d rather play soccer than listen to this.

35
00:02:07.188 --> 00:02:09.718
Danny: No, I’ve got proof.

36
00:02:09.719 --> 00:02:12.096
Hopian gave me something.

37
00:02:12.097 --> 00:02:15.110
Brad: A map to his magic giant land?

38
00:02:15.111 --> 00:02:21.570
Danny: No. I wish it was a map, though. Here.

39
00:02:21.571 --> 00:02:23.541
Brad: What’s that?

40
00:02:23.542 --> 00:02:25.925
Danny: It’s clay from Hopian’s world.

41
00:02:25.926 --> 00:02:28.834
It’s going to help us get there.

42
00:02:28.835 --> 00:02:34.601
Brad: That’s just the clay from art class.

43
00:02:34.602 --> 00:02:36.872
Tina: The clay is glowing, Brad.

44
00:02:36.873 --> 00:02:42.158
That clay didn’t glow.

45
00:02:42.159 --> 00:02:44.512
Danny: What is it?

46
00:02:44.513 --> 00:02:49.449
Brad: This clay is not from our world.
